  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx = (√2352 ÷ √1200) ÷ √0.04\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n√a ÷ √b = √(a/b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nStep 1: Simplify the numerator:\n\n√2352 ÷ √1200 = √(2352 / 1200)\n\n⇒ √1.96\n\n⇒ 1.4\n\nStep 2: Divide by √0.04:\n\nx = 1.4 ÷ √0.04\n\n⇒ 1.4 ÷ 0.2\n\n⇒ 7\n\nStep 3: Calculate (x + 1) / (x - 1):\n\n(x + 1) / (x - 1) = (7 + 1) / (7 - 1)\n\n⇒ 8 / 6\n\n⇒ 4 / 3\n\n**∴ The value of (x + 1) / (x - 1) is 4/3.**",
